{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0250-s001", "text": "En mödrarådgivning är en hälsovårdstjänst där mamman och hela familjen får vägledning och råd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0250-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.27423095703125, "generation_seconds": 34.03736015805043, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0250-s002", "text": "På mödrarådgivningen följer man upp den gravida kvinnans och fostrets välbefinnande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0250-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.301666259765625, "generation_seconds": 31.482962724985555, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0250-s003", "text": "Dessutom får hela familjen stöd med att förbereda sig för den nya babyn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0250-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.29931640625, "generation_seconds": 28.478030456928536, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0251-s001", "text": "Efter att barnet fötts följer en hälsovårdare på rådgivningsbyrån upp hur barnet växer och utvecklas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0251-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.28662109375, "generation_seconds": 30.500442720018327, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0251-s002", "text": "Hälsovårdaren diskuterar också med familjen om sådant som gäller barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0251-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.276397705078125, "generation_seconds": 19.834160447120667, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0251-s003", "text": "Rådgivningsbyrån är avgiftsfri, och alla familjer kan gå dit.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0251-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.305084228515625, "generation_seconds": 18.791472177021205, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0252-s001", "text": "För föräldrar som väntar sitt första barn ordnar rådgivningsbyrån en familjeförberedelsekurs.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0252-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.29388427734375, "generation_seconds": 24.482553011970595, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0252-s002", "text": "På kursen berättar hälsovårdare om hur man ska ta hand om babyn och om livet med en baby.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041556600203Z/hb-c09-u0252-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.268768310546875, "generation_seconds": 20.77639953303151, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0253-s001", "text": "Mammor som är permanent bosatta i Finland kan ansöka om moderskapsunderstöd hos FPA.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0253-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.36907958984375, "generation_seconds": 25.261444279924035, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0253-s002", "text": "Moderskapsunderstödet kan fås antingen i form av en moderskapsförpackning eller i pengar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0253-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.392913818359375, "generation_seconds": 24.574772604042664, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0253-s003", "text": "Moderskapsförpackningen innehåller saker som babyn behöver de första månaderna, till exempel kläder, en åkpåse och produkter för babyvård.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0253-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.842176870748299, "peak": 0.283355712890625, "generation_seconds": 34.64020464895293, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0253-s004", "text": "Allt är packat i en stor låda som kan användas som babyns första säng.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0253-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.62945556640625, "generation_seconds": 17.45065758097917, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0254-s001", "text": "Staten började dela ut moderskapsunderstöd till mindre bemedlade mammor på 1930-talet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0254-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.286865234375, "generation_seconds": 30.27612216002308, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0254-s002", "text": "Med hjälp av det fick mammor och babyer tillgång till hälsovård och barndödligheten började minska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0254-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.233154296875, "generation_seconds": 23.362311213975772, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0254-s003", "text": "Från och med år 1949 har alla mammor i Finland fått understödet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0254-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.335174560546875, "generation_seconds": 21.52316172909923, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0255-s001", "text": "I Finland föder så gott som alla mammor på ett förlossningssjukhus.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T041958351049Z/hb-c09-u0255-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.42327880859375, "generation_seconds": 23.16636291705072, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0255-s002", "text": "Där hjälper en barnmorska mamman under förlossningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0255-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.319122314453125, "generation_seconds": 17.954030271153897, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0255-s003", "text": "En barnmorska är en sjukskötare som är specialiserad på förlossningar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0255-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.29266357421875, "generation_seconds": 23.166279716882855, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0255-s004", "text": "Det är vanligt att också babyns andra förälder är med vid förlossningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0255-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.354278564453125, "generation_seconds": 23.49429814494215, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0256-s001", "text": "I Finland är könsstympning av flickor och kvinnor ett brott.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0256-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.292510986328125, "generation_seconds": 23.736757320119068, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0256-s002", "text": "Det är också förbjudet i lag att stänga slidans öppning på nytt efter en förlossning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0256-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.2901611328125, "generation_seconds": 22.862354299984872, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0257-s001", "text": "I Finland är könsstympning av flickor ett allvarligt brott, som kan ge flera års fängelsestraff.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0257-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.47064208984375, "generation_seconds": 25.669866079930216, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0257-s002", "text": "En finsk medborgare eller en flicka som bor här permanent får inte könsstympas i Finland eller något annat land.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0257-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.31451416015625, "generation_seconds": 38.20851809810847, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0257-s003", "text": "En vuxen får alltså inte ta med sig en flicka från Finland till ett annat land för att tvinga henne att genomgå könsstympning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042348515020Z/hb-c09-u0257-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.403656005859375, "generation_seconds": 36.3270644871518, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0258-s001", "text": "Omskärelse av pojkar är inte förbjuden i lag i Finland, men utförs inte inom den offentliga hälsovården utan medicinsk orsak.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0258-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.075918367346938, "peak": 0.297515869140625, "generation_seconds": 37.4645669630263, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0258-s002", "text": "Endast legitimerade läkare får utföra omskärelse.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0258-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.28875732421875, "generation_seconds": 16.18657644884661, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0259-s001", "text": "Vanligen måste du vara stadigvarande bosatt i Finland eller arbeta i Finland för att kunna få stöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0259-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.295379638671875, "generation_seconds": 27.19242394901812, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0259-s002", "text": "Barnets medborgarskap påverkar inte huruvida du får stöd eller inte.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0259-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.240631103515625, "generation_seconds": 19.593079952988774, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0259-s003", "text": "Föräldrarnas uppehållstillstånd däremot kan påverka vilka stöd familjen kan få.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0259-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.29559326171875, "generation_seconds": 26.557170377811417, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0260-s001", "text": "Om du bor i Finland kan du ha rätt till moderskapsunderstöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0260-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.28131103515625, "generation_seconds": 24.02902967086993, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0260-s002", "text": "Moderskapsunderstödet är antingen en moderskapsförpackning eller ett fast skattefritt belopp, du väljer vilket alternativ du vill ha.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0260-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.354557823129252, "peak": 0.381927490234375, "generation_seconds": 44.67769598495215, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0260-s003", "text": "Moderskapsförpackningen innehåller babykläder och vårdartiklar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T042753954787Z/hb-c09-u0260-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.2705078125, "generation_seconds": 20.927428961964324, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0261-s001", "text": "Du har rätt till moderskapsunderstöd då", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T043208229487Z/hb-c09-u0261-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.2874755859375, "generation_seconds": 18.766053057974204, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0262-s001", "text": "graviditeten varat i cirka fem månader,", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T043208229487Z/hb-c09-u0262-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.3155517578125, "generation_seconds": 19.3584732550662, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0264-s001", "text": "du har gjort en läkarundersökning före utgången av den fjärde graviditetsmånaden och", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T043208229487Z/hb-c09-u0264-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.267181396484375, "generation_seconds": 29.57195804314688, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0265-s001", "text": "du bor stadigvarande i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-radgivning/narration-resume-20261103T043208229487Z/hb-c09-u0265-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.1346938775510202, "peak": 0.270721435546875, "generation_seconds": 18.08650996698998, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
